// rising(X) and falling(X) in a guard: the edge between the value the rules
// read (last cycle's, the committed half) and this cycle's sample. A rising
// edge is 0 -> 1, a falling one 1 -> 0 -- they were the other way round.
#digital B in 2:7

#variable Rises = 0
#variable Falls = 0

Rises = Rises + 1 ? rising(B)
Falls = Falls + 1 ? falling(B)
